01:08:28.000 --> 01:08:32.000
Chuala mi iad, nuair a bhiodh iad

01:08:32.000 --> 01:08:35.000
a’ cronachadh chloinne bho chionn fhada,

01:08:35.000 --> 01:08:40.000
bhiodh iad ag ràdh: ‘Slaisidh mi do thiùmpain’.

01:08:40.000 --> 01:08:42.000
Mhm?

01:08:43.000 --> 01:08:47.000
Agus chuala mi cuideachd boireannach eile 

01:08:47.000 --> 01:08:50.000
ag èigheadh ri a h-ogha:

01:08:50.000 --> 01:08:53.000
‘Ma bheireas mis’ ort, tha mi–

01:08:53.000 --> 01:08:56.000
ma bheireas mise ort cha bhi diochuimhn’ aig do gheamann air.’

01:08:56.000 --> 01:08:57.000
[Laughter]

01:08:57.000 --> 01:08:59.000
Chan eil mise cinnteach gun tuirt e sin

01:08:59.000 --> 01:09:01.000
ach tha mi a’ smaoineachadh gu bheil mi–

01:09:01.000 --> 01:09:02.000
Gur e an aon rud a th’ ann.

01:09:02.000 --> 01:09:04.000
Gheibh thu sainnseal.
Gheibh thu dè?

01:09:04.000 --> 01:09:07.000
Gheibh thu sainnseal. A blow.

01:09:07.000 --> 01:09:09.000
Sainnseal?
Sainnseal, seadh.

01:09:10.000 --> 01:09:11.000
[BREAK IN TAPE]

01:09:11.000 --> 01:09:13.000
Air do bhurradh.

01:09:13.000 --> 01:09:17.000
Bhurradh? Dè bha sin a-nise?

01:09:18.000 --> 01:09:21.000
Oh dìreach, a bhith air do phronnadh.

01:09:20.000 --> 01:09:21.000
Do phronnadh. [laughs]

01:09:22.000 --> 01:09:29.000
[END OF TAPE]